    <main class="main-content" id="main-content">
        <div id="projects" style="padding-top: 30px;" class="section active">
            <button id="sidebarToggle" class="openbtn">
				Sidebar
			</button>
            <button id="AIToggle" class="creation-nav-link-btn active" data-target="ai">
				Public
			</button>
            <button id="BookToggle" class="creation-nav-link-btn" data-target="books">
				Private
			</button>

            <div id="ai" class="section-c1 active">
                <h1 style="margin: 25px;">Public Gallery</h1>
                <div id="ai-container" class="project ai-card-container">
                    <div id="project-1" class="ai-card">
                        <img src="./Images/DL-001-DEVI.png" alt="AI Project 1" />
                        <div class="ai-card-content">
                            <h2>DL-001 DEVI</h2>
                            <p>The name "Devi" could be derived from "devil" or "devious," hinting at a mischievous or mysterious nature. The red accents and bright eyes give it a somewhat eerie but captivating look, fitting for a creature with a slightly
                                enigmatic or playful character.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="project-2" class="ai-card">
                        <img src="./Images/DL-002-CIRLET.png" alt="AI Project 2" />
                        <div class="ai-card-content">
                            <h2>DL-002 CIRCLET</h2>
                            <p>The name "Cirlet" might come from "circle" or "circuit," possibly referencing the circular eye and body features of this creature. The name suggests a sense of completeness and perhaps a connection to technology or energy,
                                aligning with its glowing and otherworldly appearance.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="project-3" class="ai-card">
                        <img src="https://onlinetestcase.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/10.4-MB.png" alt="AI Project 3" />
                        <div class="ai-card-content">
                            <h2>DL-003 HIDA</h2>
                            <p>The name "Hida" could be a play on "hide" or "hidden," suggesting that this creature might have stealthy or elusive qualities. Its softer features and dark mask-like face give it an appearance of being both approachable and
                                mysterious, possibly hinting at a dual nature of being both a guardian and a secret keeper.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="books" class="section-c1">
                <h1>Book Series</h1>
                <div id="book-container" class="book book-card-container">
                    <div id="book-1" class="book-card">
                        <img src="./Images/ph1.png" alt="Book 1" />
                        <div class="book-card-content">
                            <a href="#" class="book-title">
                                <h2>Book 1</h2>
                            </a>
                            <div class="chapter-list">
                                <a href="#" class="chapter-link">
                                    <h3>Chapter 1</h3>
                                </a>
                                <p>Description of Chapter 1...</p>
                                <a href="#" class="chapter-link">
                                    <h3>Chapter 1</h3>
                                </a>
                                <p>Description of Chapter 1...</p>
                                <a href="#" class="chapter-link">
                                    <h3>Chapter 1</h3>
                                </a>
                                <p>Description of Chapter 1...</p>
                                <a href="#" class="chapter-link">
                                    <h3>Chapter 1</h3>
                                </a>
                                <p>Description of Chapter 1...</p>
                                <!-- Add more chapters as needed -->
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
